'''Ferric Collons''' (born December 4, 1969) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[defensive end]] for the [[New England Patriots]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL) from 1995 to 1999. He played [[college football]] for the [[California Golden Bears football|California Golden Bears]] (1987-1991).
